flowchart TD
 A[Read samples; calculate RMS] --> B{RMS > 0.02?}
 B -- Yes --> C[Refresh lastVoice; start absent turn]
 B -- No --> D[Retain timestamps]
 C --> E[speaking = voice age < 300 ms]
 D --> E
 E --> F{Active turn and voice age > 2500 ms?}
 F -- Yes --> G[Clear turnStart]
 F -- No --> H[Retain turnStart]
 G --> I[Compute elapsed duration; update panel and debug]
 H --> I
